WEBVTT

00:04:30.353 --> 00:04:32.201
This is a normal family, guys.

00:04:32.940 --> 00:04:35.766
Stacy does her best,
but she's third-generation as well;

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:38.139
she was never taught to cook
at home or at school.

00:04:38.163 --> 00:04:39.298
The family's obese.

00:04:39.322 --> 00:04:42.043
Justin here, 12 years old,
he's 350 pounds.

00:04:42.067 --> 00:04:43.735
He gets bullied, for God's sake.

00:04:43.759 --> 00:04:46.226
The daughter there, Katie,
she's four years old.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.758
She's obese before she even gets
to primary school.

00:04:49.274 --> 00:04:51.916
Marissa, she's all right,
she's one of your lot.

00:04:52.222 --> 00:04:53.245
But you know what?

00:04:53.269 --> 00:04:56.627
Her father, who was obese,
died in her arms,

00:04:56.651 --> 00:04:59.055
And then the second
most important man in her life,

00:04:59.079 --> 00:05:01.603
her uncle, died of obesity,